      "in_reply_to": null,
      "references": [],
      "body_plain": "A minor update; I found I wanted to add some points with different CI's \nto a kplot, and that proved tedious by hand, so I've added a 'kpoints' \nfunction to add points with CIs to an existing kplot. kpoints() many of \nthe same arguments as kplot itself.\n\nA build for R 2.12.2 is available at sourceforge; R-forge has, I find, \nstarted building for R 2.13.0; builds take a day or so to catch up.\nTo install from R-forge for the current version of R, use\ninstall.packages(\"metRology\", repos=\"http://R-Forge.R-project.org\")\nfrom inside R.\n\nSteve E",
      "body_snippet": "A minor update; I found I wanted to add some points with different CI's \nto a kplot, and that proved tedious by hand, so I've added a 'kpoints' \nfunction to add points with CIs to an existing kplot. k",
